<title>LATVIA: BOURSE INDEX DOWN 7.42 POINTS TO 388.64.</title>
<headline>BOURSE INDEX DOWN 7.42 POINTS TO 388.64.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock exchange said on Friday that its  index fell by 7.42 points to 388.64.</p>
<p>The bourse said in a statement that the fall was of 1.87 percent.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
